om2
note A signed add that would overflow traps (1) at run time, so that path never reaches ensures:
note twice is unsat without any requires. wrap is unsigned, wraps, and its ensures is sat at x = 2^31.
fn twice x int to int
ensures eq div result 2 x
ret add x x
end
fn wrap x uint to uint
ensures ge result x
ret add x x
end
fn main to int
ret sub twice 2 4
end
